# NOTE: committee_corpus_*.json are NOT ignored. The europarl committee votes page is
# a rolling window (older RCV PDFs age off), so the corpora are NOT reproducible from
# scratch — they are accumulating artifacts (committee_scrape.py merges, never
# overwrites). They are committed so the accumulated history is not lost.

